{"1938090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call of Duty\u00ae", "steam_appid": 1938090, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4200780, 4512480, 4233760, 4085000, 4085010, 4085020, 4085030, 4085040, 4085060, 4085070, 4085080, 4085090, 4085110, 4085120, 4085130, 4098660, 3997750, 3696030, 3498090, 3159170, 2790750, 2790730, 2790710, 2790670, 2790660, 2783780, 2795080, 2783770, 2775840, 2731850, 2686650, 2625050, 2596430, 2534810, 2493660, 2459970, 2433000, 2396490, 2387940, 2354080, 2316850, 2278280, 2137910, 2127791, 2127790, 2053671, 5008900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Call of Duty\u00ae experience supports Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Black Ops 7 and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae 4 brings players Warfare Without Limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Treyarch and Raven Software are bringing players the biggest Black Ops ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 is the massive free-to-play combat arena, featuring Battle Royale, Resurgence and Black\u00a0Ops\u00a0Royale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae Points (CP*) are the in-game currency that can be used in Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Black Ops 7, Black Ops 6, Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Modern Warfare\u00ae II and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 to obtain new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 6, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae II or Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 required to redeem. Sold / downloaded separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP purchased may also be used to obtain in-game content in certain Call of Duty\u00ae games with CP functionality enabled*. Each game sold separately.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Call of Duty\u00ae experience supports Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Black Ops 7 and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae 4 brings players Warfare Without Limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Treyarch and Raven Software are bringing players the biggest Black Ops ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 is the massive free-to-play combat arena, featuring Battle Royale, Resurgence and Black\u00a0Ops\u00a0Royale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae Points (CP*) are the in-game currency that can be used in Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Black Ops 7, Black Ops 6, Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Modern Warfare\u00ae II and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 to obtain new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 7, Call of Duty\u00ae: Black Ops 6, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae III, Call of Duty\u00ae: Modern Warfare\u00ae II or Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 required to redeem. Sold / downloaded separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP purchased may also be used to obtain in-game content in certain Call of Duty\u00ae games with CP functionality enabled*. Each game sold separately.</p>", "short_description": "The Call of Duty\u00ae experience supports Modern Warfare\u00ae 4, Black Ops 7 and Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish -